---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Data Deletion | d4lanis"
  description="Learn how to request deletion of the data associated with your interaction with mi-ai-agent, the experimental AI chatbot that operates through WhatsApp."
  path="/data-deletion"
  current="data-deletion"
>
  <h1>Data Deletion</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>

  <p class="lead">
    This page explains how you can request the deletion of the data associated with your interaction
    with <strong>mi-ai-agent</strong>, an experimental AI chatbot that operates through WhatsApp.
  </p>

  <h2 id="request">1. How to Request Deletion</h2>
  <p>You can request deletion of your data by sending an email to:</p>
  <div class="contact-box">
    <p>
      <a
        href="mailto:daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com?subject=Data%20Deletion%20Request%20%E2%80%94%20mi-ai-agent"
        >daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com</a
      >
    </p>
    <p>Please use the subject line:</p>
    <p><strong>Data Deletion Request — mi-ai-agent</strong></p>
  </div>
  <p>
    There is no automated deletion tool. Requests are reviewed and processed manually by email.
  </p>

  <h2 id="information">2. Information to Include</h2>
  <p>
    To help identify the data associated with your interaction, please include the following in your
    request:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>The WhatsApp phone number</strong> you used to interact with the chatbot (including the
      country code);
    </li>
    <li>Your name, if you would like to provide it (optional);</li>
    <li>
      A brief description of your request, for example &ldquo;please delete all data associated with my
      interaction with mi-ai-agent&rdquo;.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Providing the phone number is important because it is the main way to locate the data related to
    your conversation.
  </p>

  <h2 id="process">3. How Requests Are Processed</h2>
  <p>
    Once your request is received, it will be reviewed and the relevant data will be deleted according
    to the retention practices applicable to the services used to operate the Application. Deletion may
    take a reasonable amount of time to complete.
  </p>

  <h2 id="retention">4. Data That May Be Retained</h2>
  <p>
    In some cases, certain information may need to be retained where there is a valid legal obligation
    to do so, or where it is necessary to resolve disputes or prevent abuse. When that is the case,
    only the minimum necessary information is kept, and it is deleted once the applicable obligation no
    longer applies.
  </p>

  <h2 id="more">5. More Information</h2>
  <p>
    For details about what information is processed and how it is used, please see the
    <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. You can also review the
    <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">6. Contact</h2>
  <div class="contact-box">
    <p>
      Daniel Alanis — Independent Developer<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com">daniel.alanis.hdz@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Back to d4lanis.com</a>
</LegalLayout>
